Laravel Standards

Controllers

Controllers should only:

- Validate request
- Call Service
- Return Response

Business logic belongs in Services.

Database logic belongs in Repository.

Never write SQL in Controller.

Validation:

Use FormRequest.

Routes

Group by prefix.

Use Route Model Binding.

Use Resource Controllers.

Use Queues for:

- Emails
- Notifications
- Heavy Processing

Use Events when possible.

Always paginate large datasets.

Never use N+1 queries.

Always eager load relationships.